ols to run searches. I could potentially check mail and drive searches simultaneously, but it looks like I need to stick to codemode calls rather than a multi-tool wrapper. \\n\\nIt seems I should focus on searching for Dana's budget in mail and the budget spreadsheet in drive. Alright, let’s go ahead and perform those searches!\"}]},\"output_index\":0,\"sequence_number\":175}\n\nevent: response.output_item.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.added\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e89487d0ba59e7d88786eb89\",\"type\":\"custom_tool_call\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"call_id\":\"call_aFa9xsWYaZw2ATc3nuaJEBfM\",\"input\":\"\",\"name\":\"codemode\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":176}\n\nevent: response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\",\"delta\":\"const\",\"item_id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e89487d0ba59e7d88786eb89\",\"obfuscation\":\"qPsEkPBNTXX\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":177}\n\nevent: response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\",\"delta\":\" results\",\"item_id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e89487d0ba59e7d88786eb89\",\"obfuscation\":\"auGxIZar\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":178}\n\nevent: response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\",\"delta\":\" =\",\"item_id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e89487d0ba59e7d88786eb89\",\"obfuscation\":\"TRKzQjXrG8D1C6\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":179}\n\nevent: response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\",\"delta\":\" await\",\"item_id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e89487d0ba59e7d88786eb89\",\"obfuscation\":\"n8qiqT8b74\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":180}\n\nevent: response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.custom_tool_call_input.delta\",\"delta\":\" Promise\",\"item_id\":\"ctc_0c2011334cca2e77016af12a14e894